/target/
/tools/no-outer-fneg-of-fma/target/
# the root Cargo.lock is tracked: the golden tests pin the arithmetic identifier
# of the resolved alice-det-math, so CI must build with the recorded versions
# (nested crates such as fuzz/ keep theirs untracked)
Cargo.lock
!/Cargo.lock
# the G3 syntax-tree tool is built with --locked: its lock is tracked (identical in every carrier)
!/tools/no-outer-fneg-of-fma/Cargo.lock
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
__pycache__/
